could revive ourselves from the dead and go forward with the heritage we have in

cue0049871
01:27:49.520 --> 01:27:51.420
the modern way, he says.

cue0049872
01:27:51.880 --> 01:27:53.560
Or, we could say this

cue0049873
01:27:53.560 --> 01:27:54.860
was a wonderful meeting tonight.

cue0049874
01:27:55.720 --> 01:27:57.060
I'd like the Rabbi to speak.

cue0049875
01:27:57.240 --> 01:27:59.440
He's given all the lectures all over town.

cue0049876
01:28:00.060 --> 01:28:01.400
And we'll see him in 10 years

cue0049877
01:28:01.400 --> 01:28:02.740
if there's anybody left to see him.

cue0049878
01:28:04.860 --> 01:28:07.480
I agree

cue0049879
01:28:07.480 --> 01:28:09.520
with you. And just let me add

cue0049880
01:28:09.520 --> 01:28:10.900
something. You know,

cue0049881
01:28:12.940 --> 01:28:15.200
again,

cue0049882
01:28:17.160 --> 01:28:19.380
one of the beautiful things among

cue0049883
01:28:19.380 --> 01:28:35.380
the Sepharadi is that we love music. We love music. We love food. We love to have a good time.

cue0049884
01:28:35.380 --> 01:28:46.380
But we don't say a specific type of music. We should learn how to love different styles of Sepharadi music, different styles of food.

cue0049885
01:28:46.380 --> 01:28:51.380
food. Not always the body, but also what's going on. And let's have the children get together,

cue0049886
01:28:51.380 --> 01:29:00.380
know each other, and in other words, let me be blunt, we are the giants.

cue0049887
01:29:00.380 --> 01:29:04.380
They are the dwarves.

cue0049888
01:29:04.380 --> 01:29:08.380
It's difficult, I just take it down so many times. We climb on our shoulders.

cue0049889
01:29:08.380 --> 01:29:12.380
But they're plowing our shoulders.

cue0049890
01:29:12.380 --> 01:29:19.380
One of the things I like, I insisted, and I was successful in Brooklyn, now it becomes a kind of place.

cue0049891
01:29:19.380 --> 01:29:21.380
But Minyan for the children.

cue0049892
01:29:21.380 --> 01:29:24.380
We don't have to serve in Iraq.

cue0049893
01:29:24.380 --> 01:29:27.380
But we don't have to have our own choir.

cue0049894
01:29:27.380 --> 01:29:33.380
We have to have the ground for the people, the boys and girls to know what we feel.

cue0049895
01:29:33.380 --> 01:29:37.380
To share the different traditions, the different things.

cue0049896
01:29:37.380 --> 01:29:41.380
They're going to be more intelligent than we are, that's for sure.

cue0049897
01:29:41.380 --> 01:29:48.380
So, let me show you some Jewish orientation.

cue0049898
01:29:48.380 --> 01:29:53.380
Being Sepher Adi is a responsibility.

cue0049899
01:29:53.380 --> 01:30:01.380
Because it means you want to be Jewish 100%, and American or whatever it is, 100%.

cue0049900
01:30:01.380 --> 01:30:04.380
I feel myself 100% American.

cue0049901
01:30:04.380 --> 01:30:18.380
I love America, not 99%, 100%. I'm being proud of America. But I think, to be honest, that I love America so much because I am Jewish.

cue0049902
01:30:18.380 --> 01:30:25.380
Because my Judaism teaches me to appreciate what this country has done for all of us.

cue0049903
01:30:25.380 --> 01:30:31.380
So I don't see any contradiction between being American and being Jewish.

cue0049904
01:30:31.380 --> 01:30:36.680
On the contrary, I think that also I'm a better Jew because I'm an American.

cue0049905
01:30:36.680 --> 01:30:40.680
I learned a lot about Judaism just by living in America.

cue0049906
01:30:40.680 --> 01:30:43.480
So I don't see this contradiction.

cue0049907
01:30:43.480 --> 01:30:51.080
I think that this is something, another chance for a golden age.

cue0049908
01:30:51.080 --> 01:30:53.580
Really a golden age.

cue0049909
01:30:53.580 --> 01:30:57.980
And this is again, the ball is in our court.

cue0049910
01:30:57.980 --> 01:31:01.180
Nobody wants to play it. They cannot accept us.

cue0049911
01:31:01.180 --> 01:31:02.180
My problem.

cue0049912
01:31:02.180 --> 01:31:03.180
Yes.

cue0049913
01:31:03.180 --> 01:31:05.180
Is it possible to make your proposition?

cue0049914
01:31:08.180 --> 01:31:10.180
I would like to answer directly the question.

cue0049915
01:31:10.180 --> 01:31:12.180
No, no, I'm glad that he is a man.

cue0049916
01:31:12.180 --> 01:31:13.180
All right?

cue0049917
01:31:13.180 --> 01:31:14.180
No.

cue0049918
01:31:14.180 --> 01:31:15.180
No.

cue0049919
01:31:15.180 --> 01:31:23.180
I would like to answer, you know, to the gentleman about his worries, because we are several

cue0049920
01:31:23.180 --> 01:31:30.180
Sepharadi communities, but I don't see, you know, an entity of coordination between them.

cue0049921
01:31:30.180 --> 01:31:34.940
My proposition is this. We would like to hire you as a coordinator.
